1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:03,310
For nine years, I read my
mother's last word wrong.

2
00:00:03,310 --> 00:00:03,870
I'm Mara.

3
00:00:03,870 --> 00:00:06,100
My landlord keeps
her on a key ring.

4
00:00:06,850 --> 00:00:08,610
My mother is on a key ring.

5
00:00:08,810 --> 00:00:10,640
She came to me, you know.

6
00:00:10,640 --> 00:00:12,030
Nine years ago.

7
00:00:12,080 --> 00:00:13,220
You're lying.

8
00:00:13,320 --> 00:00:15,130
I came for you, Miss Reyes.

9
00:00:15,130 --> 00:00:17,420
You were fifteen,
and fast asleep.

10
00:00:17,420 --> 00:00:19,260
She offered me a trade.

11
00:00:19,860 --> 00:00:21,220
So she hung up her coat.

12
00:00:21,220 --> 00:00:22,180
She lit one word.

13
00:00:22,180 --> 00:00:25,890
And she walked out into the
rain, so he would never come in.

14
00:00:26,490 --> 00:00:26,750
Mara.

15
00:00:26,750 --> 00:00:27,210
The sign.

16
00:00:27,210 --> 00:00:29,050
It wasn't telling you to wait.

17
00:00:29,350 --> 00:00:30,550
She was telling him.

18
00:00:31,550 --> 00:00:33,860
All these years, I
thought she left me.

19
00:00:34,360 --> 00:00:37,290
I also died today, and
nobody has said sorry.

20
00:00:37,240 --> 00:00:38,450
Sorry, Zip.

21
00:00:38,350 --> 00:00:39,760
Thank you. Continue.

22
00:00:40,270 --> 00:00:42,040
Trade me. Let her go.

23
00:00:42,340 --> 00:00:42,890
Gladly.

24
00:00:42,890 --> 00:00:45,640
Be inside number
nine, at midnight.

25
00:00:45,640 --> 00:00:46,410
Alone.

26
00:00:46,610 --> 00:00:47,590
She's never alone.

27
00:00:47,590 --> 00:00:48,810
I'm rechargeable.

28
00:00:49,110 --> 00:00:51,260
You have until midnight.

29
00:00:52,160 --> 00:00:53,730
It was already eleven.
